- The EU views Itamar Ben-Gvir's statements regarding Gaza as unacceptable.
- European sanctions are being considered against Ben-Gvir.
- The EU has strongly and unequivocally condemned his remarks.
- The issue involves the Israeli National Security Minister.
- The context relates to the Gaza sector.


